  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to update the following pom.xml files to explicitly define an SCM section. During the release of 4.4.0, three projects required special handling during the command:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "mvn release:perform -DperformRelease -Dgoals=deploy",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Specifically, the connectionUrl had do be specified when running that command, such as:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "mvn release:perform -DperformRelease -Dgoals=deploy -DconnectionUrl=scm\\:git\\:git@github.com\\:fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-swordserver.git",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In analyzing which project needed a specified connectionUrl and which simply worked, I notice that the projects that worked have an SCM section defined in their pom.xml, the ones that did not work did not have an SCM section.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to add SCM sections to the following projects:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "fcrepo4",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "fcrepo-module-auth-webac",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "fcrepo4-swordserver",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "fcrepo-karaf",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    }
   ],
