  "description": "<p>This task is to update the following pom.xml files to explicitly define an SCM section. During the release of 4.4.0, three projects required special handling during the command:<br/>\nmvn release:perform -DperformRelease -Dgoals=deploy</p>\n\n<p>Specifically, the connectionUrl had do be specified when running that command, such as:<br/>\nmvn release:perform -DperformRelease -Dgoals=deploy -DconnectionUrl=scm\\:git\\:git@github.com\\:fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-swordserver.git</p>\n\n<p>In analyzing which project needed a specified connectionUrl and which simply worked, I notice that the projects that worked have an SCM section defined in their pom.xml, the ones that did not work did not have an SCM section.</p>\n\n<p>This task is to add SCM sections to the following projects:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>fcrepo4</li>\n\t<li>fcrepo-module-auth-webac</li>\n\t<li>fcrepo4-swordserver</li>\n\t<li>fcrepo-karaf</li>\n</ul>\n",
